      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. The Deputy Mayor for Operations hereby is delegated the authority to perform all functions, powers or duties of the Mayor which the Mayor is authorized to delegate, in the event that the Mayor is unable to perform such functions, powers or duties for a reason specified in subdivision a of section 10 of the New York City Charter. In the event that both the Mayor and the Deputy Mayor for Operations are unable to perform such functions, powers or duties for a reason specified in subdivision a of section 10 of the Charter, such authority is delegated to the Deputy Mayor for Economic Development and Planning. In the event that the Mayor, the Deputy Mayor for Operations and the Deputy Mayor for Economic Development and Planning are unable to perform such functions, powers or duties for a reason specified in subdivision a of section 10 of the Charter, such authority is delegated to the Deputy Mayor for",
